 "timing_rationale": "Leading: an open model that matches the frontier arrives before prices and market shares in the model layer adjust to it.",
 "tracker_interpretation": "Read at each open-weights record and at the newest model in Epoch's file, so the lag keeps growing through a stretch with no new record; the ECI points gap on the capture lens is the companion reading.",
